      "kind": "fire",
      "description": "A firebomb was thrown through the front window of the Metropolitan Community Church at 150 Eureka Street about 2:30 a.m. on 16 November 1990. The fire was quickly confined and damaged some pews and carpet in the sanctuary; the city offered a $5,000 reward.",
